    "name": "Galactic Deck Clash",
    "steam_appid": 3802670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your crystals wisely, collect and upgrade your cards!Buy equipment and runes to create powerful combinations and defeat increasingly stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Card Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast collection of cards with unique effects\u2014build the deck you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/d9a28c05a05550b6c18a95a97f55684e.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/d9a28c05a05550b6c18a95a97f55684e.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/d9a28c05a05550b6c18a95a97f55684e.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Deployment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The damage dealt each turn depends not only on card strength but also on how you position them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/4099b3d69ffba3d89d1cbfbb0fe2de53.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/4099b3d69ffba3d89d1cbfbb0fe2de53.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/4099b3d69ffba3d89d1cbfbb0fe2de53.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Goals, Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach or exceed the target score to win, but be careful\u2014your enemies will keep getting stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/78401822c5e9d3c261de71b6ffcd95bc.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/78401822c5e9d3c261de71b6ffcd95bc.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/78401822c5e9d3c261de71b6ffcd95bc.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management at the Space Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the space station, you can purchase cards, equipment, and runes, dismantle cards, and even upgrade them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/dd263d690bba13b23d5a575522e3fcf9.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Card Upgrade System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a powerful card held back by tough conditions? Don't worry! Replace trigger conditions, add effects, and turn even ordinary cards into powerhouses with a single upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/17f0b1bc5d67cb82593921c1e577ecf1.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece of equipment offers unique effects and can be combined with your cards to create synergies and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/12995d2f636685f05483349ad802c042.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/12995d2f636685f05483349ad802c042.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/12995d2f636685f05483349ad802c042.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Rune System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes boost your deck significantly. Play cards matching rune conditions to unleash powerful effects and stat boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/dae5c1e982b9f6b1b872049dd0d11c8b.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on the Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character, deck, and runes to start your ever-changing card adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/9c671f3e5a7d19da682d6c27eeed02e7.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your crystals wisely, collect and upgrade your cards!Buy equipment and runes to create powerful combinations and defeat increasingly stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Card Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast collection of cards with unique effects\u2014build the deck you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/d9a28c05a05550b6c18a95a97f55684e.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/d9a28c05a05550b6c18a95a97f55684e.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/d9a28c05a05550b6c18a95a97f55684e.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Deployment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The damage dealt each turn depends not only on card strength but also on how you position them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/4099b3d69ffba3d89d1cbfbb0fe2de53.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/4099b3d69ffba3d89d1cbfbb0fe2de53.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/4099b3d69ffba3d89d1cbfbb0fe2de53.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Goals, Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach or exceed the target score to win, but be careful\u2014your enemies will keep getting stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/78401822c5e9d3c261de71b6ffcd95bc.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/78401822c5e9d3c261de71b6ffcd95bc.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/78401822c5e9d3c261de71b6ffcd95bc.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management at the Space Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the space station, you can purchase cards, equipment, and runes, dismantle cards, and even upgrade them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/dd263d690bba13b23d5a575522e3fcf9.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Card Upgrade System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a powerful card held back by tough conditions? Don't worry! Replace trigger conditions, add effects, and turn even ordinary cards into powerhouses with a single upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/17f0b1bc5d67cb82593921c1e577ecf1.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece of equipment offers unique effects and can be combined with your cards to create synergies and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/12995d2f636685f05483349ad802c042.poster.avif?t=1753285283\" width=440 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/12995d2f636685f05483349ad802c042.webm?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/12995d2f636685f05483349ad802c042.mp4?t=1753285283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Rune System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes boost your deck significantly. Play cards matching rune conditions to unleash powerful effects and stat boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/dae5c1e982b9f6b1b872049dd0d11c8b.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on the Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character, deck, and runes to start your ever-changing card adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/9c671f3e5a7d19da682d6c27eeed02e7.avif?t=1753285283\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
